post_install(){
 cat <<INFO
If you want to download new graphhopper.com extracts periodically:

Adjust the 'PHOTON_GRAPHHOPPER_EXTRACT' environment variable using 'systemctl edit photon-update' to select an extract to use.
See '/usr/bin/photon-update' for available extracts.

Run 'photon-update.service' for an initial download and enable 'photon-update.timer' for weekly updates of the database.
Note that the photon service will be down during updates.

'photon.service' should now be running, enable it as needed.
INFO
}
